sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant App as React app
  participant DB as Supabase (Postgres)

  Admin->>App: Fill in event form, set Invite-only
  App->>DB: insert into events
  DB-->>App: new event row
  App->>DB: insert into sessions (one or more)
  DB-->>App: new session rows
  Admin->>App: Open Manage Invitees, search students
  App->>DB: select from students
  DB-->>App: matching students
  Admin->>App: Add student to roster
  App->>DB: insert into event_invitee_periods
  DB-->>App: new invite period row
  App-->>Admin: Updated invitee roster
